BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 376.80 Tm (a desiccant. The active substance, strength and shelf life are unchanged.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 363.60 Tm (Sites should exhaust existing blister stock before dispensing the new) Tj ET
